        "description": {
            "value": "<p>This small steel buckler (Hardness 6, HP 24, BT 12) is engraved with an unbroken golden circle. While you have this shield raised, you gain resistance 5 to mental damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate—Mind Backlash</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">r</span> (manipulate)</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You succeed at a Will save against a mental effect while the shield of mental fortitude is raised</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> You return a wave of psychic energy to the creature. The creature that caused the triggering mental effect must succeed at a @Check[will|dc:27] save or become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stupefied]{Stupefied 1} (@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stupefied]{Stupefied 2} on a critical failure).</p>"
